+### FU-9. Payment-related status problems
+
+- **A paid order with a refund cannot be fulfilled when "allow unpaid fulfillment" is off.** The gate
+  is `total_charged >= total.gross`. A refund lowers the charged total, so the remaining items are
+  refused with "Cannot fulfill unpaid order." while the order shows as fully charged.
+  Setting-dependent (`fulfillment_allow_unpaid=False`; the default is on). Verified,
+  `saleor/order/models.py:441-442`, `saleor/graphql/order/mutations/order_fulfill.py:192-203`.
+- **With manual order confirmation, a paid unconfirmed order containing a digital gift card is
+  auto-fulfilled.** The gift-card code is emailed before staff review, the status leaves
+  "unconfirmed", and `orderConfirm` then refuses the order. Setting-dependent
+  (`automatically_confirm_all_new_orders=False`). Verified, `saleor/order/actions.py:402-409`,
+  `saleor/giftcard/utils.py:216-288`.
+- **A late payment revives a cancelled or expired order.** Becoming fully paid recomputes the status
+  for any non-draft order, so it returns to "unfulfilled" with no stock allocated. Verified,
+  `saleor/order/actions.py:408-409`.
+- **A second "fully paid" event on an order with a digital gift card raises an error.** The
+  auto-fulfillment runs again with nothing left to fulfil and fails after the payment amounts are
+  saved; the fully-paid webhooks are skipped. Verified for the mechanism,
+  `saleor/order/actions.py:566`, `saleor/giftcard/utils.py:257-288`.
+
+### FU-10. Tracking updates and approvals overwrite each other
+
+- **What happens:** both `orderFulfillmentUpdateTracking` and `approve_fulfillment` save the whole
+  fulfillment row from a copy read earlier. A tracking update that read the row just before an
+  approval can write the status back to "waiting for approval" after stock was taken; an approval
+  can erase a tracking number. Tracking updates are also accepted, and emailed, for cancelled
+  fulfillments.
+- **When:** concurrent for the overwrite; every time for the cancelled case.
+- **Where:** `saleor/graphql/order/mutations/fulfillment_update_tracking.py:61-76`;
+  `saleor/order/actions.py:874-875`.
+- **Status:** Verified.
+
+### FU-11. `FULFILLMENT_APPROVED` is not sent for most shipments
+
+- **What happens:** in the default auto-approve mode the webhook is sent only for the fulfillment
+  that makes the order completely fulfilled. Partial shipments never produce it.
+  `FULFILLMENT_CREATED` is sent from the approval path, so in manual-approval mode nothing but
+  `ORDER_UPDATED` announces a waiting fulfillment.
+- **When:** every time.
+- **Where:** `saleor/order/actions.py:591-610`, `630-641`.
+- **Status:** Verified.
