+- **When:** every time.
+- **Where:** `saleor/graphql/order/mutations/order_grant_refund_create.py:293-325`;
+  `order_grant_refund_update.py:449-468`.
+- **Status:** Verified.
+
+### RR-11. Order and stock state after refunds and returns
+
+- **Returns never put stock back.** There is no code path for it. This is absent functionality, not
